      <figure>
        <img src="https://www.shigamuseum.jp/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/a¦a¸¸ae¨a¹aeai¼aci¼.jpg" alt="â¦ä¸¸æ¨ã¹ãèåï¼åçï¼" />
